<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">2 TI -Yemsa New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">2 Ximotiyos</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Timotiyosni matsafa</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Timotiyos</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Tim.</para>
  <para style="mt2">Wosi Phawulosni Hepsa Wosiya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ximotiyosnik</para>
  <para style="imt1">Gachgiru</para>
  <para style="ip">Phawulos Ximotiyosnik tichina han hepsa wosiyaas Pawulosnin tai'sonon argasi wostoni zoomobay sina na'o Ximotiyosnik imna kiitooson ephowa. Daysire dey kiitinaas fakiyak chinukwa. Ximotiyos kiitonewa chinuni kaama dannaas Yesus Kiristoosni chowaason amanamtok zaala makonak zaggire ephanaknawa awune faaronnu shanaasewa tugga'oose arkifanaknu assuusiknawa misirachuni kaamaasi makoni wostoosikna duudonakwa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ximotiyos arkiron teetbaason oodanak maktenaas gowwumak zagtefa sinnooy kirikiriissin wokanakwa. Es effatena wuzaas odefe baassotin tishkutano ooma ke'fana wuzaba aafawa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Es wuza zuuttambaase asik Ximotiyos yadatonak sholsinaas Phawulosni kaasewa foose arkiron dey amantobaason; fakibaason; keeshtanbaason; chimbaasonnawa kabugtok basaasta kar'a shanaasi besok zoonustonakwa.</para>
  <para style="iot">Matsafaas Siruk Ephna Ephobaas</para>
  <para style="io1">Gachgiru <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ximotiyosnik imte kiito <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 1:3-2:13">1:3—2:13</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Mormoni kabaasik amanamto sinne besto <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 2:14-4:5">2:14—4:5</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Es kabaasik faase wuzaaasikkitonewa sholsu zoonsune <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 4:6-18">4:6-18</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Koor'uba <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 4:19-22">4:19-22</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1"/>Yesus Kiristoosnikin beste kaani abdiisik Ha'oosi fiqadik Yesus Kiristoosni wosi sina Phawulosnikin woste wosiya; <verse eid="2TI 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2"/>Shunto naata Ximotiyosnik; aba Ha'oniiskinnawa Daamni Yesus Kiristoosnikinna otumnewa fakine dey nagane neek sinfawungwa.<verse eid="2TI 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ximotiyosnik Imte Kiito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3"/>Wonna wonna wonne waalne shiiphonaasik neen safarefana kabaasik ta abani meya zagsetesimato ta dey kayma kanuk barik wostefana Ha'ooson galattefawungwa. <verse eid="2TI 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4"/>Arafneeson yaadatedifawungwa; es bari boor'a akamanon gironak neen biyanak kaltefawungwa. <verse eid="2TI 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5"/>Neekik fa futoni amantooson yaadatedifan. Effatena amantoos zeemma afane Loyidniki dey intone Ewunqekiktu fawa. Neekik dey faanamato aringwa. <verse eid="2TI 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6"/>Es bari boor'a kushunaason neyista ta'ifana kabaasik neek imte geenimato sinna neyissi fa Ha'oosi imanon hepsa wolgira geenimato saamma daysit hamanak yaadatsifawungwa. <verse eid="2TI 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7"/>Ha'o innok imna imaas hugnanir, keeshtannir, dey teetni ha'suni Korto Ayyanatano digani ayyanatawa. <verse eid="2TI 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8"/>Ese Daamniisa chowanon makooson iichchotaata. Basa boor'a taatere fe taak dey iichchotaata. Sinuntano Ha'o neek imana hugnaasik misirachchuni kaamaasi boor'a yooni shanaason ephphatowa. <verse eid="2TI 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9"/>Bar inno zagini ma'a wostok sinnoynamato teetbaasi shunaknawa otumbaasikna innotin fati. Korto sinna foonik innotin teege. Es otmaason neyaneen sinak Yesus Kiristoosniki kamo innok imi. <verse eid="2TI 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10"/>Es otmaas innotin fati Yesus Kiristoos yoobaasik ammanon beste. Bar kituusi hugnanon tishkire misirachchuni kaamaaski kamo kitunoy koi'ba foonto kaa ammanon innok besi.<verse eid="2TI 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11"/>Ta dey es misirachchuni kaamaason makoni wosi; assinynya sinna teegten. <verse eid="2TI 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12"/>Han rakkooson ephphataat faanaas es bari boor'awa. Sinuntano oonin amanenamato arifana boor'a aafa iichchonawuza. Ta imna adaraason Kiristoos wolle yoona kabaneen bar ooda chimanamato arifawungwa. <verse eid="2TI 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13"/>Taakin arita amanamto kaamaason beso zagira Yesus Kiristoosnik fa amantoosiknawa keeshtanaasikna oodwa. <verse eid="2TI 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14"/>Innoossi faafa korto Ayyanaaski kamo neek imte ma'a adaraason oodwa.<verse eid="2TI 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15"/>Iisiyani awurajjaassi fe baasso zuuttere taan beyye hametemato arifatwa. Baasso ganeyaassin Figelusnawa Hermogenesna feeseter. <verse eid="2TI 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16"/>Daamiis Onesiforni keerki meyak fakibaason imawowa. Bar showo wona taan chini. Taatonaasiknu aane iichchowe. <verse eid="2TI 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17"/>Roomki katama yeena kabaasik dey sholefe sholefetu taan dani. <verse eid="2TI 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18"/>Mangsuni kar'ni wono Daamiis fakibaason imawowa. Efesonuk faana kabaasik awune faaron taan argasinamato ne teetneesik mai'sira arifatwa.<verse eid="2TI 1:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Kiristoosni Amanamto Meya Taar'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1"/>Ese naataaso! Yesus Kiristoosnikin bestefa otmaasik chimwa. <verse eid="2TI 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2"/>Showo zaalni meeni sinak taakin arita aruuson oomni meyanon assuk chimni baassoknawa amanamto asuni meyakna adara imma. <verse eid="2TI 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3"/>Ne dey Yesus Kiristoosni ma'a meya taar'o sinna taneen ane shanaason ephphatowa. <verse eid="2TI 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4"/>Taar'o sinne wostefe asu meya taar'oosa gaanynyanin girsuk hooro sinanaktu sholsifatano taar'oos teetbari wostoossi aane girife. <verse eid="2TI 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5"/>Esiisimato aato aato eelfe asu tumbaasimato eela shakaanane merere es merena bari wossuma aafa danana wuza. <verse eid="2TI 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6"/>Wostok hopife bulinynyaas wostena gaanaassin tesuniison dananak sholsifawa. <verse eid="2TI 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7"/>Daamiis zuuttambaase asik yaadata neek imana sinna boor'a ta makefana baron mai'sira yaadatowa. <verse eid="2TI 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8"/>Kitun kabi barinnawa Dawitni zalaassin sina Yesus Kiristoosnin yaadatowa. Ta makefana misirachchuni kaamaas esiiswa. <verse eid="2TI 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9"/>Es misirachchuni kaamaasi boor'a mangsi asunimato shashsharak taatera shana ephpha taadifangwa. Sinuntano Ha'oosi kaama aafawa taatona wuza. <verse eid="2TI 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10"/>Es bari boor'a baasso dey Yesus Kiristoosnik fa faruuski kamo bestefa koi'ba foonto ulfina danonek Ha'o korina asuni meyakwa iyaat zuuttambaase asin fakifaan. <verse eid="2TI 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11"/>Ekka yifa kaamaas amantowa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">«Barneen ane kitifaanine;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:11">barneen ane dey kaak fooni.<verse eid="2TI 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12"/>Fakiyak chima yerefaanine;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">barneen ane taattoni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">mormefaanine bar dey;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">innotin mormonawa.<verse eid="2TI 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13"/>Inno amanamto asu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">sina shakaanine;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">bar teetbaason;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">aafa mormona wuza sinna boor'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">aagenu amanamto sinnetu foona.»<verse eid="2TI 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Chim Wostinynya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14"/>Han chowaason yaadatsonek zaguwa. Kaamtan kabi chowa karakkarsonoytemato Ha'oosi sina teetbesiison oodosonek zaguwa. Es kaamni karakkaroos odesefe asuni meyanontu tishkunatano isa wuzaknu aane ke'fa. <verse eid="2TI 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15"/>Futoni Ha'oosi kaamanon likkik katife asunimatonawa wostobaasik iichchonoy wostinynya sinna teetneeson Ha'oosi sina tai'sukna dey girsi asu sinatak duudowa. <verse eid="2TI 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16"/>Han daastaki chownewa shima sina wollaastan wokwa. Es effatena wollaas asuni meyanon Ha'oostan daysire wokosonektu zagifawa. <verse eid="2TI 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17"/>Es baasso assus farunoy mazanimatotu tagit hamfa. Es baasso ganeyaassin Hemenewosnawa Filtosna feeseter. <verse eid="2TI 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18"/>Es asuni meya: «Kitun kabu zeemo sinaktu siniwa» yit karakkarok futoostan wokete. Dey isa isa asuni meeni amantooson shorkisefewa. <verse eid="2TI 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19"/>Sinuntano «Daamiis basar sina baassotin arifewa» Esiisimatonu: «Daamiisa sunanon teegefe baasso zuuttere manguustan wokosoto» yistera tichchera shorkonoy Ha'oosi kaptaasta maatamak ichchewa.<verse eid="2TI 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20"/>Inya keyaassi warqeknawa birrikna wosuste koda koi'ba sinnoynaron i'okin wosuste kodanewa ooche kodane faaser. Es barissin isa isaas ulfinto wostok; isa isaas ulfinba foonto wostotatu feeshfa. <verse eid="2TI 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21"/>Es mangu wuzaassin kortere kesse kayim sinne feefe asus ulfinto wostota feeshfa kodaasne feer sinana. Ma'a wostok hoore bar Daamiisik korto sinne feere ke'ni koda sinana.<verse eid="2TI 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22"/>Na'oni meeni mangu eenantoostan wokwa. Kayma nibak Daamiisin teegsefe asuni meyaneen ane sinna ookooson, amantooson, keeshtanaason, nagaason sholowa. <verse eid="2TI 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23"/>Chowa ephpha yoonamato arira gowwa sinaastannawa ke'noy shima karakkarostan wokwa. <verse eid="2TI 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24"/>Daamni wostinynya sina asu zuuttambaase asik garam, assuk chimarnawa fakirna sinanaktu sholsifatano faassonak aane sholsifawa. <verse eid="2TI 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25"/>Bar tugga'esefe baassotin garamak kiitir sinanak sholsifa. Awuzakne futooson arsonek Ha'oos harmini ugna baassok imak chimana. <verse eid="2TI 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26"/>Esiisimato nibbesiiski wolsere Daabulos basa fiqadiison zagsonek baassotin ephni eshmiyaassin aatte kesonewa.<verse eid="2TI 2:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Koi'ni Wonaas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1"/>Koi'ni wono rakkisuni wona yoonamato aruwa. <verse eid="2TI 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2"/>Asuni meya teetbesiison keeshter, Waagni danak joorer, ge'eser, beganter, me'eser, aba intoosik ajajamonor, galatbesi foonto, kortobesi foonto, <verse eid="2TI 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3"/>Keeshtanbesi foonto, feeshun usonor, asuni suna mangsiser, teetbesiison ha'sunor, keena budu, ma'ar sina wuzason oomteser, <verse eid="2TI 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4"/>Mormeser, teetbesi oodnor, beegantok tuumme feeser, Ha'ooson shunaastan ashbesiison girsu shunar sinone. <verse eid="2TI 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5"/>Ha'ooson shiiphediferne feer sinnetu bestesefe; sinuntano Ha'oosi shiiphoni hugnanon mormesefe. Es effetena asuni meyaastan wokwa. <verse eid="2TI 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6"/>Es asuni meya keya keyaassi aatte girifaafe showo boor'besi tuultera faana showo tesa igak zoonustesefa hopiya ayyanabesi faana mashkasuson baasso ha'suussi zagsefe asuni meyane feeseterwa. <verse eid="2TI 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7"/>Es effatena mashkasusikito wonna wonnatu arsesefe; sinuntano futooson aruta kar'ak aane chimefe. <verse eid="2TI 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8"/>Iyyanesnawa Iyyanberesna Musenin tugga'sesetemato han baasso kanubesiis mangiranawa amantoni chowaasik gandesere feeseter sinna boor'a futooson tugga'esefe. <verse eid="2TI 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9"/>Iyyanesnawa Iyyanberesna asi gowwaas ammanon bestenamato han baasso gowwaas dey asu zuuttambaase asi sina ammanon bestonir sinna boor'a aafa wostota feeshana wuza.<verse eid="2TI 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Koi'ni Kiito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10"/>Sinuntano ne ta assuuson, ta fooson, ta alamaason, ta amantooson, ta fakiyaason, ta keeshtanaason, ephna barik chimme yeronaason arifatwa. <verse eid="2TI 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11"/>Esiisimato dey kabugtonaasonnawa ephphataana shananaasonna arifatwa. Ansokiyaknawa Ikoniyokna, dey Listirak tayista kar'a chowaasewa fakiyak ephphataana kabugtoose arifatwa. Sinuntano Daamiis zuuttambaase asiissin taan fu'ewa. <verse eid="2TI 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12"/>Futok Kiristoos Yesusnir sinne Ha'ooson girsire fook sholsefe baasso zuuttere kabugteseterwa. <verse eid="2TI 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13"/>Sinuntano mangu asuni meenawa eshtuni meena asuni meyanon eshetnawa teetbesiisik daagesetna manguusta mangu daysiset hamefe. <verse eid="2TI 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14"/>Sinuntano ne ookin aritamato aritar sinna boor'a es arita bariknawa amaneta futoosik zaguwa. <verse eid="2TI 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15"/>Daagneestanneen kabira Yesus Kiristoosnik amanok faru bestefanamato techma imfa korto matsafaasikitonon aritwa. <verse eid="2TI 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16"/>Korto matsafaasikito zuuttera Ha'oosi Ayyanani zoonsiyak tichcherwa. Es bar dey futooson assuk; daage baassotin ke'uk; daaget fooson kaanuknawa ma'a fook sinni ugna imak ke'arwa. <verse eid="2TI 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17"/>Es ke'fanaas dey Ha'oni asu zag sinanaknawa aaffa ma'a wostooson dey wostok hoorer sinne bestonakwa.<verse eid="2TI 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1"/>Ha'oosi sinaknawa dey taatobaason yeetifena kabaasik hayewni meyaastanawa kituni meyaastana mangsu kar'ni Yesus Kiristoosni sina adara yifan. <verse eid="2TI 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2"/>Kaambaason mako; mai'fanak mangifanak aagenu sinun chimma wostowa; assit, ke'itnawa kiititna; fakiyaknawa assukna chimwa. <verse eid="2TI 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3"/>Asuni meya kaa imfa assuuson odok oomtosone wona yoona. Sinuntano baasso sholsefe wuzason makoni assinynyabesirin zuutusone. <verse eid="2TI 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4"/>Es bari boor'a futosi chowanon odo beyefaat raajini odok sholsefe. <verse eid="2TI 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5"/>Sinuntano ne zuuttambaase asiistan teetneeson ood. Shanani ephphetook zagu; Misirachchuni kaamaasi makoni wostooson wosto. Neek imte wostooson zuutira koi'su. <verse eid="2TI 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6"/>Ta maa'a sinanak hooreratu fawa; han daastan dey oor kessa hamana wona kar'i. <verse eid="2TI 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7"/>Neebooson ma'arik neeben; aatatoni eelaason koi'ba kar'a eelin; amantonaason oodin. <verse eid="2TI 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8"/>Hanneen ekalo ookoni akilili taak hoorera faar. Es akililiison futok mangsu kar'fe Daamiis es kabaasik taak imana. Imanaas dey taak koi'ba sinnoynaron basa ammanon bestooson kaltesefe baassokneengwa.<verse eid="2TI 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Teetni Chowa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9"/>Taptera hang taaki yootak duudowa. <verse eid="2TI 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10"/>Deemas han daasta fa wuzason shunne tayistan oor kesse Teselonqe hami; Kerqiis Galatiya hami; Tiito dey Dilmatiya hami. <verse eid="2TI 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11"/>Taneen ane feyiis Luqas koi'ba. Marqos Ha'oni wostok ke'nir sinna boor'a sholera taak ephpha yowa. <verse eid="2TI 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12"/>Tikiqosnin Efeson wosingwa. <verse eid="2TI 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13"/>Yaafata kabaasik Tiroaddak Karpusniki esta kunsina kombortaason taak ephpha yowa. Matsafaasiktonon arkiron dey Birannani matsafaason taak ephpha yowa. <verse eid="2TI 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14"/>Bitta ki'fe Iskindir akama miir'a tayista kati. Daamiis wostobaasimato barik kaasuna. <verse eid="2TI 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15"/>Bar inno makefeni baron mai'sire tugga'er sinna boor'a nenu teetneeson basaastan oodwa.<verse eid="2TI 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16"/>Ta malattena chowaasik tesuni malsiison wolgifana kabaasik zuuttambesiisetu tayistan woketetano taneen ane yerere taan argasir oonu aafe. Es baron dey Ha'oos mangsu zagira baassosta faadunaata. <verse eid="2TI 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17"/>Sinuntano wosiyaas taaki kamo zuuttera maktonaknawa Aazabni meya zuuttere odosonek Daamiis taneen ane sinne taan chini. Eetoosa noonosin dey fu'ten. <verse eid="2TI 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18"/>Daamiis mangu wuza zuuttambaase asiissin taan fu'ona. Samak fa taatobaasta taan taamme katuna. Barik koi'ba foontonon ulfina sinfawungwa! Aamin.<verse eid="2TI 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Koi'ni Nagani Ooshsho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19"/>Prisqillaknawa Aqilakna; Onesiforimni keerki meyak naganaason mako. <verse eid="2TI 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20"/>Erastos Qoronxos katama fu'te; Trofomos mettena boor'a Milixin beyya yaan. <verse eid="2TI 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21"/>Yeeshu girunoyfen taaki taptere yook duudowa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 4:21">Ewubulus, Phudes, Linos, Kilawudiyanewa amanynyini meene zuuttere naga maksedife. <verse eid="2TI 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22"/>Daamiis neneen ane sino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 4:22">Ha'oosi otma nittoneen ane sinfawung.<verse eid="2TI 4:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4"/>
</usx>
